    "updated_at": "2022-06-29T10:51:19Z",
    "body": "Another consideration is SVG. In https://software.hixie.ch/utilities/js/live-dom-viewer/?saved=10422 I tested copying text in SVG and found that in Chrome, Firefox and Safari (all on macOS) the \"copy\" event is fired with `SVGTextElement` as the target. But there are no event handler attributes on `SVGElement`.\r\n\r\nOops: There is, via https://svgwg.org/svg2-draft/types.html#InterfaceSVGElement",
